  "difficulty_reason": "The construction alternates functorial homotopy-killing pushouts with an injective-term cone enlargement along an ordinal of uniformly large cofinality. A bounded-size acyclic test class, transfinite acyclic filtration and exact inverse Hom limits control all unbounded complexes; this is well beyond ordinary qualification resolution theory.",
